  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flowius Micro-Utility Incubator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3BL Enterprises has developed Flowius, a program which builds radically affordable piped water systems to get water into the homes of rural Ethiopians. We do this by combining an engineering philosophy emphasizing affordability with a suite of mobile tools for technical and financial management, while utilizing a network of rurally-based franchises to implement our work. We&apos;ve already piped water to 500 homes and have already gotten our engineering, construction, and technology figured out. Our goal is to solve the final piece of the puzzle: effectively finance Ethiopian water micro-grids.</narrative>
  </description>
